I go to the court.
Three people are there.
They are playing for practice.
I go near them.
I say - "Namaste!"
"My name is Maya."
One woman smiles.
She says - "Namaste Maya, I am Neha."
"This is Amit, and this is Sanjay."
I say - "I like to play doubles."
"Can I play here?"
Amit says - "Certainly, you can play!"
"There are only three players here."
"So you can also play."
Sanjay asks - "Are you ready to play now?"
I show my racket.
I say - "Yes, I can play well."
They are very friendly.
Now I go to play with them.
